## Where the context lives

- Domain context loads automatically: `bre-domain-<slug>.md` when a request matches the domain, `bre-domain-<slug>-code.md` when a domain file is open.
- Read on demand: `$context_dir/domains/<slug>/summary.md`, `$context_dir/domains/<slug>/reviewed-rules.md`, `$context_dir/impact-map.md` (+ `impact-map.json`, `file-index.json`), `$context_dir/variant-map.md`, `$context_dir/glossary.md` (`#bre-glossary`), `$context_dir/review-status.md`.
- Raw extraction: `$bre_dir/` (domain folders under `detailed-domain-bre/`).
